  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "s1-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. 基础 NLP 指标 —— EM / F1 / BLEU / ROUGE / BERTScore\n",
    "\n",
    "这些指标适用于「能背标准答案」的任务（如 QA、摘要），对开放问答**不够**。\n",
    "\n",
    "**关键指标**：\n",
    "- **EM（Exact Match）**：完全匹配 → 1，否则 0（最严格）\n",
    "- **F1（F1-Score）**：精确率 + 召回率的调和平均（适用于分词对齐）\n",
    "- **BLEU**：n-gram 重叠（翻译任务，不推荐 RAG 用）\n",
    "- **ROUGE**：n-gram 重叠（摘要任务，不推荐 RAG 用）\n",
    "- **BERTScore**：用 BERT embedding 做语义相似度，对同义改写更友好"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s1-c1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# OFFLINE 模式：模拟不同指标的计算\n",
    "\n",
    "def exact_match(prediction, ground_truth):\n",
    "    \"\"\"EM：完全匹配\"\"\"\n",
    "    return int(prediction.strip() == ground_truth.strip())\n",
    "\n",
    "def f1_score(prediction, ground_truth):\n",
    "    \"\"\"F1：分词对齐\"\"\"\n",
    "    # 简化版：把句子按词分割，计算交集\n",
    "    pred_tokens = prediction.split()\n",
    "    gt_tokens = ground_truth.split()\n",
    "    pred_set, gt_set = set(pred_tokens), set(gt_tokens)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    if not pred_set and not gt_set:\n",
    "        return 1.0\n",
    "    \n",
    "    precision = len(pred_set & gt_set) / len(pred_set) if pred_set else 0\n",
    "    recall = len(pred_set & gt_set) / len(gt_set) if gt_set else 0\n",
    "    \n",
    "    return 2 * (precision * recall) / (precision + recall) if (precision + recall) > 0 else 0\n",
    "\n",
    "# 测试用例\n",
    "test_cases = [\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        'prediction': 'Transformer 是 2017 年 Google 提出的注意力机制架构。',\n",
    "        'ground_truth': 'Transformer 是 2017 年 Google 提出的注意力机制架构。',\n",
    "        'description': '完全匹配'\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        'prediction': 'Transformer 是基于注意力的。',\n",
    "        'ground_truth': 'Transformer 是 2017 年 Google 提出的注意力机制架构。',\    "        'description': '短语 vs 完整句子'\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        'prediction': 'Transformer 是 Google 2017 年提出的模型。',\n",
    "        'ground_truth': 'Transformer 是 2017 年 Google 提出的注意力机制架构。',\n",
    "        'description': '同义改写'\n",
    "    }\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "print('=== 不同指标计算结果 ===')\n",
    "for i, case in enumerate(test_cases):\n",
    "    em = exact_match(case['prediction'], case['ground_truth'])\n",
    "    f1 = f1_score(case['prediction'], case['ground_truth'])\n",
    "    print(f'\\n[案例 {i+1}] {case[\"description\"]}')\n",
    "    print(f'  pred: {case[\"prediction\"]}')\n",
    "    print(f'  gt:   {case[\"ground_truth\"]}')\n",
    "    print(f'  EM:   {em}')\n",
    "    print(f'  F1:   {f1:.3f}')\n",
    "\n",
    "print('\\n**关键差异**：')\n",
    "print('  - EM: 最严格，同义改写一定 0')\n",
    "print('  - F1: 比较友好，同义改写可能有分值')"